<title>UK: Westfaelische Hypo sets 150 mln mark REX bond.</title>
<headline>Westfaelische Hypo sets 150 mln mark REX bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SGZ Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTFAELISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.60	MATURITY    26.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.30    PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.0	 SELL CONC  1.5	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	**FIRST COUPON, THEN REX-10 YEAR SUBINDEX X 81 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
